Misty: Mistee face value is $1 per the page data; 2% outcome gives two free spins

The odds-table data behind the box page values every Mistee outcome at
100 cents per Mistee (valueCents, fxRate 1), so the $1 face is Misty's own
figure rather than an assumption. The 2% Free Spin outcome carries
freeSpins: 2, so it is worth about 5.4 Mistees, not 3.7. Comments, guides
and the box note updated; smoke: stated 65.9%, realized 64.6%, cash 36.0%.

